var VSX={"en": {"Mt 11, 28": "Come to me, all you that labour, and are burdened, and I will refresh you.", "Mt 7, 7": "Ask, and it shall be given you: seek, and you shall find: knock, and it shall be opened to you.", "Mt 5, 8": "Blessed are the clean of heart: for they shall see God.", "Mt 16, 18": "And I say to thee: That thou art Peter; and upon this rock I will build my church, and the gates of hell shall not prevail against it.", "Jn 2, 19": "Destroy this temple, and in three days I will raise it up.", "Jn 14, 6": "I am the way, and the truth, and the life. No man cometh to the Father, but by me.", "Jn 15, 12": "This is my commandment, that you love one another, as I have loved you.", "Jn 8, 12": "I am the light of the world: he that followeth me, walketh not in darkness, but shall have the light of life.", "Jn 10, 30": "I and the Father are one.", "Jn 16, 33": "These things I have spoken to you, that in me you may have peace. In the world you shall have distress: but have confidence, I have overcome the world.", "Jn 17, 21": "That they all may be one, as thou, Father, in me, and I in thee; that they also may be one in us; that the world may believe that thou hast sent me.", "Lc 23, 34": "Father, forgive them, for they know not what they do.", "Lc 23, 46": "Father, into thy hands I commend my spirit.", "Jn 19, 30": "It is consummated.", "Ac 19, 28": "Great is Diana of the Ephesians.", "1 Co 13, 2": "and have not charity, I am nothing."}, "es": {"Mt 11, 28": "Venid a mí todos los que andáis agobiados con trabajos y cargas, que yo os aliviaré.", "Mt 7, 7": "Pedid, y se os dará; buscad, y hallaréis; llamad, y os abrirán.", "Mt 5, 8": "Bienaventurados los que tienen puro su corazón; porque ellos verán a Dios.", "Mt 16, 18": "Y yo te digo, que tú eres Pedro, y que sobre esta piedra edificaré mi Iglesia, y las puertas o poder del infierno no prevalecerán contra ella.", "Jn 2, 19": "Destruid este Templo, y yo en tres días le reedificaré.", "Jn 8, 12": "Yo soy la luz del mundo: el que me sigue, no camina a oscuras, sino que tendrá la luz de la vida.", "Jn 10, 30": "Mi Padre y yo somos una misma cosa.", "Jn 14, 6": "Yo soy el camino, y la verdad, y la vida: nadie viene al Padre, sino por mí.", "Jn 15, 12": "El precepto mío es, que os améis unos a otros, como yo os he amado a vosotros.", "Jn 16, 33": "Estas cosas os he dicho con el fin de que halléis en mí la paz. En el mundo tendréis grandes tribulaciones; pero tened confianza: yo he vencido al mundo.", "Jn 17, 21": "Ruego que todos sean una misma cosa, y que como tú ¡oh Padre! estás en mí, y yo en ti por identidad de naturaleza, así sean ellos una misma cosa en nosotros por unión de amor; para que crea el mundo que tú me has enviado.", "Lc 23, 34": "Padre mío, perdónales, porque no saben lo que hacen.", "Lc 23, 46": "Padre mío, en tus manos encomiendo mi espíritu.", "Jn 19, 30": "Todo está cumplido.", "Ac 19, 28": "Viva la gran Diana de los efesios.", "1 Co 13, 2": "no teniendo caridad, soy un nada."}};
